From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: musa <musa@local>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] MUSA: optimize hybrid attention page-size fastpath

Keep align-mode Mamba state metadata and dedicated-pool admission compatible
with the 64-token attention page fastpath.
